#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:4
msgid "Warp Experimental Environments"
msgstr "Warp 实验性环境"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:8
msgid ""
"The warp environment infrastructure lives in ``isaaclab_experimental`` and "
"``isaaclab_tasks_experimental``. It's an experimental feature."
msgstr ""
"Warp 环境基础设施位于 ``isaaclab_experimental`` 和 ``isaaclab_tasks_experimental`` "
"，属于实验性功能。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:11
msgid ""
"The experimental extensions introduce **warp-first** environment "
"infrastructure with CUDA graph capture support. All environment-side "
"computation (observations, rewards, resets, actions) runs as pure Warp "
"kernels, eliminating Python overhead and enabling CUDA graph capture for "
"maximum throughput."
msgstr ""
"实验性扩展引入了 **以 Warp 为核心** 、支持 CUDA 图捕获的环境基础设施。环境侧计算（观测、奖励、重置、动作）全部以纯 Warp "
"内核运行，消除 Python 开销，并通过 CUDA 图捕获获得更高吞吐量。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:15
msgid ""
"Throughout this page, **stable** refers to the standard Torch-based "
"implementations in the ``isaaclab`` and ``isaaclab_tasks`` packages (the "
"default runtime, used when ``--frontend warp`` is not passed). Their Warp "
"counterparts live in the ``isaaclab_experimental`` and "
"``isaaclab_tasks_experimental`` packages."
msgstr ""
"本页中的 **稳定版** 指 ``isaaclab`` 和 ``isaaclab_tasks`` 包中基于 Torch 的标准实现，即未传入 "
"``--frontend warp`` 时使用的默认运行时。对应的 Warp 实现位于 ``isaaclab_experimental`` 和 "
"``isaaclab_tasks_experimental`` 包。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:22
msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "工作流程"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:24
msgid "Two environment workflows are supported:"
msgstr "支持两种环境工作流程："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Direct workflow** — ``DirectRLEnvWarp`` base class. You implement the step"
" loop, observations, rewards, and resets directly in your env class using "
"Warp kernels."
msgstr ""
"**直接式工作流程** — 使用 ``DirectRLEnvWarp`` 基类，在环境类中通过 Warp 内核直接实现步进循环、观测、奖励和重置。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Manager-based workflow** — ``ManagerBasedRLEnvWarp`` base class. You "
"define MDP terms as standalone Warp-kernel functions and compose them via "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"**基于管理器的工作流程** — 使用 ``ManagerBasedRLEnvWarp`` 基类，将 MDP 项定义为独立的 Warp "
"内核函数，再通过配置组合。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:34
msgid "Available Environments"
msgstr "可用环境"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:37
msgid "Direct Warp Environments"
msgstr "直接式 Warp 环境"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:39
msgid ""
"Direct tasks share the stable task configuration. ``--frontend warp`` "
"resolves the stable ``<task>_direct_env:<Name>Env`` entry point to the "
"mirrored ``<task>_warp_env:<Name>WarpEnv`` implementation and swaps only the"
" environment class. Registrations can use ``warp_entry_point`` as an "
"optional override when the implementation cannot follow this convention. "
"Stable tasks with a Warp implementation:"
msgstr ""
"直接式任务共享稳定版任务配置。 ``--frontend warp`` 将稳定版 ``<task>_direct_env:<Name>Env`` "
"入口解析为对应的 ``<task>_warp_env:<Name>WarpEnv`` 实现，只替换环境类。实现无法遵循此约定时，注册可以使用可选的 "
"``warp_entry_point`` 覆盖。以下稳定版任务具有 Warp 实现："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:46
msgid "``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` — Cartpole balance"
msgstr "``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` — Cartpole 平衡"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:47
msgid "``Isaac-Ant-Direct`` — Ant locomotion"
msgstr "``Isaac-Ant-Direct`` — Ant 运动"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:48
msgid "``Isaac-Humanoid-Direct`` — Humanoid locomotion"
msgstr "``Isaac-Humanoid-Direct`` — 人形机器人运动"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:49
msgid "``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro-Direct`` — Allegro hand cube reorient"
msgstr "``Isaac-Reorient-Cube-Allegro-Direct`` — Allegro 手立方体重定向"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:53
msgid "Manager-Based Warp Execution (``--frontend warp``)"
msgstr "基于管理器的 Warp 执行（ ``--frontend warp`` ）"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:55
msgid ""
"Manager-based tasks do not need a parallel warp registration: the shared RL "
"CLI exposes ``--frontend {torch,warp}``, and ``--frontend warp`` adapts the "
"*stable* task configuration onto the warp runtime at build time (swapping "
"each MDP term for its warp twin). Select the Newton solver explicitly with "
"``presets=newton_mjwarp``. Stable tasks with full twin coverage:"
msgstr ""
"基于管理器的任务无需另行注册 Warp 版本：共享强化学习命令行提供 ``--frontend {torch,warp}`` ， "
"``--frontend warp`` 在构建时将 *稳定版* 任务配置适配到 Warp 运行时，将各 MDP 项替换为对应的 Warp 实现。请通过 "
"``presets=newton_mjwarp`` 显式选择 Newton 求解器。以下稳定版任务的全部项都有对应实现："

