#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:209
msgid "Which Workflows Benefit Most"
msgstr "哪些工作流程收益最大"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:211
msgid ""
"The savings come from eliminating Python / torch overhead in the env's step "
"loop, so envs gain in proportion to how much of their step time was "
"previously dominated by per-kernel CPU overhead. Reading the table above:"
msgstr ""
"性能收益来自消除环境步进循环中的 Python/Torch 开销，因此原先逐内核 CPU 开销在步进时间中占比越高，环境收益越大。上表可解读为："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:215
msgid ""
"**Manager-based classic RL** (Cartpole, Ant) — biggest gains (-52% to -54%)."
" Many small reward / observation terms with low compute per term, so per-"
"launch CPU overhead dominated the stable baseline."
msgstr ""
"**基于管理器的经典强化学习** （Cartpole、Ant）— 收益最大，步进时间减少 52%–54%。其奖励/观测项多而小，每项计算量低，逐次启动的"
" CPU 开销主导了稳定版基线。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:218
msgid ""
"**Manager-based locomotion** (AnymalD, G1, H1, Cassie, UnitreeGo2) — "
"consistent -21% to -38% range. The MDP has more terms but the underlying "
"physics step is heavier, so the relative Python savings shrink."
msgstr ""
"**基于管理器的运动任务** （AnymalD、G1、H1、Cassie、UnitreeGo2）— 稳定减少 21%–38%。MDP "
"项更多，但底层物理步也更重，因此节省 Python 开销的相对比例减小。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:221
msgid ""
"**Direct workflow** — gains scale with how much the env's step body was "
"Python (Ant -51%, Cartpole -18%, Allegro hand -10%). Direct envs that "
"already wrote most of their work as GPU kernels see modest gains; ones with "
"substantial Python state machinery see large ones."
msgstr ""
"**直接式工作流程** — 收益随环境步进主体中的 Python 占比变化（Ant 减少 51%、Cartpole 减少 18%、Allegro 手减少"
" 10%）。多数工作已写为 GPU 内核的直接式环境收益较小，包含大量 Python 状态处理的环境收益较大。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:224
msgid ""
"**Compute-heavy / scene-write-heavy envs** (Allegro hand, large humanoids) —"
" see smaller relative gains because the warp-side savings are amortised over"
" a heavier step. Components that still go through torch (scene write, "
"actuator models) currently bound the floor; this is expected to improve as "
"remaining components migrate to warp."
msgstr ""
"**计算密集 / 场景写入密集的环境** （Allegro 手、大型人形机器人）— 相对收益较小，因为 Warp "
"侧节省的时间在较重的步进中占比较低。仍通过 Torch 运行的组件（场景写入、执行器模型）目前限制了最低步进时间；其余组件迁移到 Warp "
"后预计会改善。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:229
msgid ""
"If your env's step time is dominated by physics or scene I/O, expect modest "
"gains. If it has many small MDP terms or a lot of Python in the step loop, "
"expect large ones. Use the benchmarking workflow below to measure on your "
"task before committing to a migration."
msgstr ""
"如果环境步进时间主要消耗在物理或场景 I/O 上，预期收益较小；如果包含大量小型 MDP 项或大量 Python "
"步进逻辑，预期收益较大。决定迁移前，请使用下述基准测试流程测量自己的任务。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:235
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:237
msgid ""
"The warp env path is experimental and has the following known constraints. "
"These are specific to warp envs; for Newton physics maturity and specialist "
"guides see :ref:`physics-backends-newton`."
msgstr ""
"Warp 环境路径处于实验阶段，具有以下已知约束。这些约束仅针对 Warp 环境；Newton 物理的成熟度和专题指南见 :ref:`physics-"
"backends-newton` 。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:241
msgid "**Physics backend**"
msgstr "**物理后端**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:243
msgid ""
"**Newton only.** PhysX is not supported under the warp env path. Asset and "
"sensor ``class_type`` fields resolve to ``isaaclab_physx.*`` classes that "
"depend on ``omni.physics.tensors`` (a Kit module the warp runtime does not "
"initialise), and several warp APIs (env-mask reset, CUDA graph capture) "
"require the Newton articulation. Configure the cfg with a Newton physics "
"block (or the typed selector ``physics=newton_mjwarp``, which fails loudly "
"if the task has no Newton physics preset)."
msgstr ""
"**仅支持 Newton。** Warp 环境路径不支持 PhysX。资产和传感器的 ``class_type`` 字段解析为 "
"``isaaclab_physx.*`` 类，它们依赖 ``omni.physics.tensors`` （Warp 运行时不初始化的 Kit "
"模块）；多个 Warp API（环境掩码重置、CUDA 图捕获）还要求使用 Newton 关节体。请为配置设置 Newton "
"物理部分，或使用带类型选择器 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` ；任务没有 Newton 物理预设时，后者会明确报错。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:250
msgid "**MDP coverage**"
msgstr "**MDP 覆盖范围**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:252
msgid ""
"Only the terms listed under :ref:`Available Warp MDP Terms <warp-env-mdp-"
"terms>` are implemented. Stable envs that depend on un-migrated terms cannot"
" be run on the warp path until those terms are ported."
msgstr ""
"目前仅实现了 :ref:`可用的 Warp MDP 项 <warp-env-mdp-terms>` "
"中列出的项。稳定版环境如果依赖尚未迁移的项，需要先移植这些项，才能使用 Warp 路径运行。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:255
msgid ""
"Some scene-side operations (asset write, actuator models, certain sensor "
"types) still go through torch. They participate in the step but are not yet "
"captured into the graph; they set the lower bound on observed step time."
msgstr "部分场景侧操作（资产写入、执行器模型、某些传感器类型）仍通过 Torch 运行。它们参与步进，但尚未捕获进图，限制了观测到的最低步进时间。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:258
msgid ""
"Sensors that depend on the Kit RTX renderer (camera-based observations) "
"cannot be combined with the warp env path — they need Kit, which the warp "
"runtime does not initialise."
msgstr ""
"依赖 Kit RTX 渲染器的传感器（基于相机的观测）不能与 Warp 环境路径组合，因为它们需要 Kit，而 Warp 运行时不初始化 Kit。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:261
msgid "**API differences vs stable**"
msgstr "**与稳定版的 API 差异**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:263
msgid ""
"Reset events use a boolean ``env_mask`` (``wp.array(dtype=wp.bool)``) "
"instead of an ``env_ids`` list. This is required for capture safety: "
"variable-length indexing changes graph topology and breaks replay."
msgstr ""
"重置事件使用布尔 ``env_mask`` （ ``wp.array(dtype=wp.bool)`` ），而非 ``env_ids`` "
"列表。这是图捕获安全性的要求：可变长度索引会改变图拓扑并破坏回放。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:266
msgid ""
"All buffers must be pre-allocated in ``__init__``. There is no dynamic "
"allocation inside the captured step loop, so observation / reward / "
"termination output dimensions must be known at env init."
msgstr ""
"所有缓冲区必须在 ``__init__`` 中预分配。捕获的步进循环中不允许动态分配，因此观测、奖励和终止输出的维度必须在环境初始化时确定。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:269
msgid ""
"Term functions write into a pre-allocated ``out`` buffer rather than "
"returning a tensor. See :ref:`warp-env-migration` for the kernel + launch "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"项函数将结果写入预分配的 ``out`` 缓冲区，而不是返回张量。内核与启动函数的编写模式见 :ref:`warp-env-migration` 。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:271
msgid ""
"Code inside the captured step loop must follow capture-safety rules (no "
"``wp.to_torch``, no torch arithmetic, no lazy-evaluated properties, no "
"Python branching on GPU data). See :ref:`warp-env-capture-safety` for the "
"full set of rules."
msgstr ""
"捕获的步进循环内，代码必须遵循图捕获安全规则：不能使用 ``wp.to_torch``、Torch 运算、惰性求值属性，也不能根据 GPU 数据进行 "
"Python 分支判断。完整规则见 :ref:`warp-env-capture-safety` 。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:278
