msgstr "``summary`` 格式化器输出步进时间（最小/平均/最大）和总吞吐量。比较两次运行的“step time”，估计每个环境步的收益。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:316
msgid "**Sweep across all available tasks**"
msgstr "**遍历所有可用任务**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:318
msgid ""
"Run ``isaaclab benchmark training`` for each task in the stable set "
