#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:322
msgid "**What to look at in the output**"
msgstr "**输出中应关注的内容**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:324
msgid ""
"*Step time (min / mean / max)*: the headline number — what each env step "
"costs."
msgstr "*步进时间（最小/平均/最大）*：主要指标，表示每个环境步的开销。"

