msgid ""
"*Iteration time*: includes policy update; useful for end-to-end training "
"throughput."
msgstr "*迭代时间*：包含策略更新，可用于评估端到端训练吞吐量。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:326
msgid ""
"*Capture overhead*: for warp runs, the first few iterations include CUDA "
"graph capture cost; exclude those when comparing steady-state numbers."
msgstr "*捕获开销*：Warp 运行的前几次迭代包含 CUDA 图捕获成本；比较稳态数值时应排除它们。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:329
msgid "**Estimating before you migrate**"
msgstr "**迁移前估计收益**"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:331
msgid ""
"If you can't run the warp variant yet (e.g. the task isn't ported), measure "
"the stable step time and look at where it's spent:"
msgstr "如果还不能运行 Warp 变体（例如任务尚未移植），可测量稳定版步进时间，并查看时间消耗的位置："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:334
msgid ""
"``num_envs * step_time`` dominated by physics → expect modest warp gains."
msgstr "``num_envs * step_time`` 主要消耗在物理计算上 → Warp 收益预计较小。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:335
msgid ""
"``step_time`` dominated by ``manager.compute_*`` calls → expect large gains,"
" since those are exactly what the warp managers replace with captured kernel"
" launches."
msgstr ""
"``step_time`` 主要消耗在 ``manager.compute_*`` 调用上 → 收益预计较大，因为 Warp "
"管理器正是将这些调用替换为捕获的内核启动。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:338
msgid ""
"Use ``--num_steps`` on ``runtime.py`` for a no-policy step-time "
"microbenchmark when you want to isolate env overhead from policy compute."
msgstr ""
"需要区分环境开销与策略计算时，可在 ``runtime.py`` 上使用 ``--num_steps`` ，进行无策略的步进时间微基准测试。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:345
msgid "Migrating Existing Environments"
msgstr "迁移已有环境"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:347
msgid ""
"This section covers the key conventions and patterns used by the warp-first "
"environment infrastructure, useful for migrating existing torch environments"
" or creating new ones natively: project layout, the kernel + launch pattern "
"shared by observations / rewards / events / terminations / actions, capture-"
"safety rules, and parity testing."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍 Warp 优先环境基础设施使用的主要约定和编写模式，供迁移已有 Torch 环境或直接创建 Warp "
"环境时参考，包括项目布局，观测、奖励、事件、终止和动作共用的内核与启动函数模式，以及图捕获安全规则和行为一致性测试。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:354
msgid "Design Rationale"
msgstr "设计依据"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:356
msgid ""
"The warp environment path is built around `CUDA graph capture "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-programming-guide/04-special-topics/cuda-"
"graphs.html>`_. A CUDA graph records a sequence of GPU operations (kernel "
"launches, memory copies) during a capture phase, then replays the entire "
"sequence with a single launch. This eliminates per-kernel CPU overhead — the"
" parameter validation, kernel selection, and buffer setup that normally "
"costs 20–200 μs per operation is performed once during graph instantiation "
"and reused on every replay (~10 μs total). All CPU-side code (Python logic, "
"torch dispatching) executed during capture is completely bypassed during "
"replay. See the `Warp concurrency documentation "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/stable/deep_dive/concurrency.html>`_ for "
"Warp's graph capture API (``wp.ScopedCapture``)."
msgstr ""
"Warp 环境路径围绕 `CUDA 图捕获 <https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-programming-"
"guide/04-special-topics/cuda-graphs.html>`_ 构建。CUDA 图在捕获阶段记录一系列 GPU "
"操作（内核启动、内存拷贝），随后通过一次启动回放整个序列。这消除了逐内核的 CPU 开销：通常每次操作需要 20–200 μs "
"的参数验证、内核选择和缓冲区设置，在图实例化时只执行一次，之后每次回放复用（总计约 10 μs）。捕获期间执行的全部 CPU 端代码（Python "
"逻辑、Torch 分发）在回放时都会被跳过。Warp 图捕获 API（ ``wp.ScopedCapture`` ）见 `Warp 并发文档 "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/stable/deep_dive/concurrency.html>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:367
msgid ""
"All design decisions in the warp infrastructure follow from this constraint:"
" every operation in the step loop must be a GPU kernel launch with stable "
"memory pointers so that the captured graph can be replayed without "
"modification."
msgstr "Warp 基础设施的所有设计都遵循这一约束：步进循环中的每个操作都必须是使用稳定内存指针的 GPU 内核启动，使捕获的图无需修改即可回放。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:371
msgid "Key consequences:"
msgstr "由此带来的主要要求："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:373
msgid ""
"All buffers are **pre-allocated** — no dynamic allocation inside the step "
"loop"
msgstr "所有缓冲区都 **预先分配** — 步进循环内不动态分配"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:374
msgid ""
"Data flows through **persistent ``wp.array`` pointers** — never replaced, "
"only overwritten"
msgstr "数据通过 **持久的** ``wp.array`` **指针** 传递 — 只覆盖内容，不替换数组"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:375
msgid ""
"MDP terms are **pure ``@wp.kernel`` functions** — no Python branching on GPU"
" data"
msgstr "MDP 项是 **纯** ``@wp.kernel`` **函数** — 不在 Python 中根据 GPU 数据分支"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:376
msgid ""
"Reset uses **boolean masks** (``env_mask``) instead of index lists "
"(``env_ids``) to avoid variable-length indexing that changes graph topology"
msgstr "重置使用 **布尔掩码** （ ``env_mask`` ）代替索引列表（ ``env_ids`` ），避免可变长度索引改变图拓扑"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:381
msgid "Project Structure"
msgstr "项目结构"

