msgstr "项配置类具有相同接口，只改变导入路径。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:411
msgid "Common Pattern"
msgstr "通用模式"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:413
msgid ""
"All warp MDP terms (observations, rewards, terminations, events, actions) "
"follow the same **kernel + launch** pattern. Torch terms use torch tensors "
"and return results; warp terms write into pre-allocated ``wp.array`` output "
"buffers via ``@wp.kernel`` functions:"
msgstr ""
"所有 Warp MDP 项（观测、奖励、终止、事件、动作）均遵循 **内核 + 启动** 模式。Torch 项使用 Torch 张量并返回结果；Warp"
" 项通过 ``@wp.kernel`` 函数写入预分配的 ``wp.array`` 输出缓冲区："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:432
msgid "The output buffer shapes differ by term type:"
msgstr "输出缓冲区形状因项类型而异："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:434
msgid ""
"**Observations**: ``(num_envs, D)`` where D is the observation dimension"
msgstr "**观测** ： ``(num_envs, D)`` ，其中 D 为观测维度"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:435
