"Warp 项写入预分配缓冲区，因此观测管理器必须在初始化时知道各项的输出维度，才能分配正确的 ``(num_envs, D)`` "
"输出数组。维度通过逐级回退机制确定（见 "
"``isaaclab_experimental/managers/observation_manager.py`` 中的 "
"``ObservationManager._infer_term_dim_scalar`` ）："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:451
msgid ""
"The IO descriptor decorators are deprecated in Isaac Lab 3.0 and will be "
