"中移除。在替代的运行时配置开发完成前，其输出维度元数据暂时保留，供以 Warp 为核心的环境使用。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:456
msgid "**Explicit ``out_dim`` in decorator** (preferred):"
msgstr "**装饰器中显式设置** ``out_dim`` （推荐）："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:463
msgid ""
"``out_dim`` can be an integer, or a string that resolves at initialization:"
