#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:478
msgid ""
"**Legacy params**: ``term_dim``, ``out_dim``, or ``obs_dim`` keys in "
"``term_cfg.params``."
msgstr ""
"**旧式参数** ： ``term_cfg.params`` 中的 ``term_dim`` 、 ``out_dim`` 或 ``obs_dim`` "
"键。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:480
msgid ""
"**Asset config fallback**: Count of ``asset_cfg.joint_ids`` (or "
"``joint_ids_wp``) for joint-level terms."
msgstr ""
"**资产配置回退** ：对于关节级项，使用 ``asset_cfg.joint_ids`` （或 ``joint_ids_wp`` ）的数量。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:485
msgid "Event Terms"
msgstr "事件项"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:487
msgid ""
"Events use ``env_mask`` (boolean ``wp.array``) instead of ``env_ids``, and "
"each kernel checks the mask to skip non-selected environments:"
msgstr "事件使用 ``env_mask`` （布尔 ``wp.array`` ）代替 ``env_ids`` ，各内核检查掩码以跳过未选中的环境："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:502
msgid ""
"RNG uses per-env ``env.rng_state_wp`` (``wp.uint32``) instead of "
"``torch.rand``"
msgstr "随机数生成使用逐环境 ``env.rng_state_wp`` （ ``wp.uint32`` ），而非 ``torch.rand``"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:503
msgid ""
"**Startup/prestartup** events use the torch convention ``(env, env_ids, "
"**params)``"
msgstr "**启动/预启动** 事件使用 Torch 约定 ``(env, env_ids, **params)``"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:504
msgid ""
"**Reset/interval** events use the warp convention ``(env, env_mask, "
"**params)``"
msgstr "**重置/间隔** 事件使用 Warp 约定 ``(env, env_mask, **params)``"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:508
msgid "Action Terms"
msgstr "动作项"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:510
msgid ""
"Actions follow a **two-stage execution**: ``process_actions`` (called once "
"per env step) scales and clips raw actions, and ``apply_actions`` (called "
"once per sim step) writes targets to the asset. Both stages use warp kernels"
" with pre-allocated ``_raw_actions`` and ``_processed_actions`` buffers."
msgstr ""
"动作采用 **两阶段执行** ： ``process_actions`` 每个环境步调用一次，对原始动作缩放和限幅； ``apply_actions``"
" 每个仿真步调用一次，将目标写入资产。两个阶段都使用 Warp 内核，以及预分配的 ``_raw_actions`` 和 "
"``_processed_actions`` 缓冲区。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:519
msgid "Capture Safety"
msgstr "图捕获安全性"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:521
msgid ""
"When writing terms that run inside the captured step loop, keep in mind:"
msgstr "编写在捕获的步进循环内运行的项时，应注意："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:523
msgid "**No ``wp.to_torch``** or torch arithmetic — stay in warp throughout"
msgstr "**不使用** ``wp.to_torch`` **或 Torch 运算** — 全程使用 Warp"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:524
msgid ""
"**No lazy-evaluated properties** — use sim-bound (Tier 1) data directly; if "
"a derived quantity is needed, compute it inline in the kernel"
msgstr "**不访问惰性求值属性** — 直接使用与仿真绑定的第一层（Tier 1）数据；需要派生量时，在内核内计算"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:526
msgid ""
"**No dynamic allocation** — all buffers must be pre-allocated in "
"``__init__``"
msgstr "**不动态分配** — 所有缓冲区必须在 ``__init__`` 中预分配"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:530
msgid "Parity Testing"
msgstr "一致性测试"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:532
msgid "Two levels of parity testing are used to validate warp terms:"
msgstr "通过两个层次的一致性测试验证 Warp 项："

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:534
msgid ""
"**1. Implementation parity (torch vs warp)** — verifies that the warp kernel"
" produces the same result as the torch implementation. This is optional for "
"terms that have no torch counterpart (e.g. new terms written directly in "
"warp)."
msgstr ""
"**1. 实现一致性（Torch 与 Warp）** — 验证 Warp 内核与 Torch 实现产生相同结果。没有 Torch "
"对应实现的项（例如直接用 Warp 编写的新项）可以不进行此测试。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:553
msgid ""
"**2. Capture parity (warp vs warp-captured)** — verifies that the term "
"produces identical results when replayed from a CUDA graph vs launched "
"directly. A mismatch here indicates capture-unsafe code (e.g. stale "
"pointers, dynamic allocation, or lazy property access that doesn't replay). "
"This test should always be run, even for terms without a torch counterpart."
msgstr ""
"**2. 捕获一致性（Warp 与图捕获后的 Warp）** — 验证 CUDA "
"图回放和直接启动产生完全相同的结果。不一致说明代码不适合捕获，例如使用了过时指针、动态分配，或回放时不会执行的惰性属性访问。即使没有 Torch "
"对应实现，也应始终运行此测试。"

#: source/concepts/warp_environments.rst:572
msgid ""
"See ``source/isaaclab_experimental/test/envs/mdp/`` for complete parity test"
" examples."
msgstr "完整的一致性测试示例见 ``source/isaaclab_experimental/test/envs/mdp/`` 。"

